        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Mathematical Analysis Notes</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #594038;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 430px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .text {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 31px;\n    top: 27px;\n    width: 355px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .line {\n    min-height: 20px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 143px;\n  }\n\n  .section {\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .explanation {\n    width: 245px;\n    white-space: normal;\n  }\n\n  .derivation {\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    width: 500px;\n  }\n\n  mjx-container {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .plot {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 274px;\n    top: 119px;\n    width: 255px;\n    height: 177px;\n    margin: 0;\n    border: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n\n  .plot figcaption {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 1px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .plot svg {\n    display: block;\n    width: 255px;\n    height: 177px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"text\">\n    <div class=\"line\">令 $F(a)=\\ln a-\\dfrac{a-1}{a+1};\\ F(1)=0$</div>\n    <div class=\"line indent\">$F'(a)=\\dfrac{1}{a}-\\dfrac{2}{(a+1)^2}=\\dfrac{a^2+1}{a(a+1)^2}>0$</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">∴ $F(a)$ 在 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上递增，$a=1$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"line\">(2)先画图分析：</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">由(1)知，$f(x)$ 在 $(-\\infty,0)$ ↘，$(0,+\\infty)$ ↗；</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">$g(x)$ 在 $(0,1)$ ↘，$(1,+\\infty)$ ↗</div>\n      <div class=\"explanation\">\n        要有三个交点则必是如右所示，考场中可用零<br>\n        点存在定理说明一下，两函数在 $(0,1)$ 上有一<br>\n        个交点 $x_0$。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"line\">出题点：</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"derivation\">\n      <div class=\"line\">$g(x_1)=g(x_0)=f(x_0)=f(x_2)$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">$e^{x_1}-x_1=e^{x_0}-x_0=x_0-\\ln x_0=x_2-\\ln x_2\\cdots$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">$x_1&lt;0,\\ 0&lt;x_0&lt;1,\\ x_2&gt;1$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">$e^{x_1}-x_1=e^{\\ln x_0}-\\ln x_0;\\ x_2-\\ln x_2=e^{x_0}-\\ln e^{x_0},\\ e^{x_0}&gt;1$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">即 $g(x_1)=g(\\ln x_0)$，$x_1,\\ln x_0&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_1=\\ln x_0$；同理 $f(x_2)=f(e^{x_0})\\Rightarrow x_2=e^{x_0}$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">$x_1+x_2=\\ln x_0+e^{x_0}=2x_0$；由(*)式可得。</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <figure class=\"plot placeholder\">\n    <figcaption>[Diagram: coordinate graph on the right]</figcaption>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 255 177\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Coordinate graph\">\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n          <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#1d1d1d\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n\n      <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#292929\" stroke-width=\"0.8\">\n        <line x1=\"1\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"253\" y2=\"132\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n        <line x1=\"105\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"105\" y2=\"5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n\n        <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"135\"/>\n        <line x1=\"117\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"117\" y2=\"135\"/>\n        <line x1=\"147\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"147\" y2=\"135\"/>\n        <line x1=\"181\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"181\" y2=\"135\"/>\n        <line x1=\"208\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"135\"/>\n        <line x1=\"235\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"135\"/>\n\n        <line x1=\"102\" y1=\"101\" x2=\"108\" y2=\"101\"/>\n\n        <path d=\"M10 66 C42 95,63 119,88 127 C104 131,120 129,137 119 C166 101,198 72,249 34\"/>\n        <path d=\"M80 35 C91 49,99 61,105 75 C111 91,118 102,127 103 C142 103,149 79,154 58 C157 46,160 34,164 24\"/>\n\n        <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"101\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"132\"/>\n        <line x1=\"117\" y1=\"101\" x2=\"117\" y2=\"132\"/>\n        <line x1=\"147\" y1=\"101\" x2=\"147\" y2=\"132\"/>\n\n        <line x1=\"66\" y1=\"101\" x2=\"157\" y2=\"101\"/>\n      </g>\n\n      <g fill=\"#282828\" font-family=\"Times New Roman, serif\" font-size=\"11\">\n        <text x=\"246\" y=\"145\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text>\n        <text x=\"97\" y=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text>\n        <text x=\"78\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n          x<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"8\">1</tspan>\n        </text>\n        <text x=\"117\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n          x<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"8\">0</tspan>\n        </text>\n        <text x=\"147\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n          x<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"8\">2</tspan>\n        </text>\n        <text x=\"43\" y=\"105\" font-style=\"italic\">y=b</text>\n      </g>\n    </svg>\n  </figure>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
